    {
      "id": "AnIZo1dZgNP4oOy4FMaB2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 35,
      "y": 85,
      "width": 238,
      "height": 229.50000000000003,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ay",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 445027929,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1940537273,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790762022769,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  TIER I\n\n  • duration ~60 s\n  • enemy sight + hearing × 0.25\n  • aggro fades faster\n     than vanilla\n  • attack ends the effect\n  • debuff: stamina regen\n     −50 % for ~20 s\n  • visual: light fog",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "t1",
      "originalText": "  TIER I\n\n  • duration ~60 s\n  • enemy sight + hearing × 0.25\n  • aggro fades faster\n     than vanilla\n  • attack ends the effect\n  • debuff: stamina regen\n     −50 % for ~20 s\n  • visual: light fog",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "6C3CFZ4JTNclgMkKJMlU8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 405,
      "y": 85,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 229.50000000000003,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "az",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1106535225,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 585462871,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790762022769,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  TIER II\n\n  • duration ~120 s\n  • enemies ignore the player\n     (like console cmd ghost)\n  • aggro lost immediately\n  • attack → revealed + debuff\n  • re-hide after ~12 s\n     without attacking\n  • visual: dense fog",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "t2",
      "originalText": "  TIER II\n\n  • duration ~120 s\n  • enemies ignore the player\n     (like console cmd ghost)\n  • aggro lost immediately\n  • attack → revealed + debuff\n  • re-hide after ~12 s\n     without attacking\n  • visual: dense fog",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "dmxnJ6b7PvsLhQ43BU2z9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 775,
      "y": 85,
      "width": 195,
      "height": 229.50000000000003,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b00",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1473614873,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 2140922009,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790762022769,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  TIER III\n\n  • duration ~180 s\n  • enemies: like tier II\n  • re-hide after ~8 s\n  • other PLAYERS barely\n     see you, no nameplate,\n     no map pin\n  • visual: shimmer\n  • needs net sync",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "t3",
      "originalText": "  TIER III\n\n  • duration ~180 s\n  • enemies: like tier II\n  • re-hide after ~8 s\n  • other PLAYERS barely\n     see you, no nameplate,\n     no map pin\n  • visual: shimmer\n  • needs net sync",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
